text:
The dish is a white bowl about 15 cm across and holds granola with strawberries, some pineapple, and dark berries or raisins. The granola is heaped on top.

I estimate about 150 g of food in total, made up of roughly 70 g granola, 50 g fruit, and some yogurt hidden underneath. Granola is about 450 kcal per 100 g, so 70 g gives roughly 315 kcal. The fruit adds about 25 kcal. If there is yogurt under the granola, it could add around 50 kcal, so I'm settling on about 300 kcal.

